Package: bifrost
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Peter Lau <liuxin_signal@163.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/peterlau123/bifrost
Description: offline machine command execution framework over shared storage
 Bifrost runs commands on machines that share a filesystem (GPFS/xfs/NFS) or
 over SSH, with a client/server split, GPU pinning per task, timeouts,
 cancellation and an MCP server for agent integration.
 .
 The package contains a statically linked binary, so it needs neither a Rust
 toolchain nor a matching glibc. After installation:
   bifrost-setup client --storage <DIR>   # 客户端（提交任务 / MCP 工具）
   bifrost-setup server --storage <DIR>   # 服务端（systemd 服务，开机自启）
